              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/boundary+of+a+simplex"} boundary of a simplex
                is the union of its faces.
            %li
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spine"} spine
